<Inner title="A Living World" eyebrow="About Theia Online" description="An independent high-fantasy MMO in development, built around exploration, layered history and living civilizations.">
  <div class="prose"><p class="lead">Theia is a world of ancient magical achievement, lost knowledge and peoples who have built lives in the aftermath of catastrophe.</p><p>Its setting is designed to reward curiosity: not just through a principal campaign, but through the local stories, traditions and conflicts that make its regions distinct.</p><h2>A world in the making</h2><p>Theia Online is in active development. Features and playable content are being built and tested in small steps. World and story previews describe the creative direction; they do not mean every region or feature is available to play today.</p><p>Visit the <a href={url('news/')}>news section</a> for progress or <a href={url('world/')}>explore the world</a> to learn more about the setting.</p></div>
</Inner>
